{
  "comment": "One row per convention a generated kit states. `kits` is the list of kits that apply it, or \"all\". The router's `## Conventions` index is generated from these rows, `id` is the anchor in agent-docs/references/conventions.md, and scripts/__tests__/kit-conventions.spec.ts fails on a row with no override, no anchor or a missing kit line. A row with `symbol` applies to exactly the kits whose src/ calls it.",
